CRUD means the four basic operations used to manage data.
CRUD	HTTP method	Example
Create	POST	Add a new user
Read	GET	View all users
Update	PUT / PATCH	Edit user details
Delete	DELETE	Remove a user

Example for an employee API:
- GET /employees — get all employees
- GET /employees/101 — get employee 101
- POST /employees — add an employee
- PUT /employees/101 — replace employee 101's details
- PATCH /employees/101 — update selected employee fields
- DELETE /employees/101 — delete employee 101
